                       "description":  "Verification results are grouped by iteration, reflecting the workflow loop structure. Each iteration is collapsible and shows its own pass/fail status and duration. Within each iteration, individual verification steps are displayed as test cards. Users can drill into any step to see console output, page snapshots, assertion counts, and error details. This hierarchical organization (iteration \u003e step \u003e details) mirrors the execution structure and helps users trace failures to specific verification phases and iterations.",
